# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the voicing on the Live page: C A F G C (Height C5: the top stays
# near), then CHORDS' Height a detent up (E5), up (G5), three down (G4), Spread 0 (close) and 24. Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
wav height.wav
tapkey 7
wait 2500
shot c.png
tapkey 4
wait 2500
shot am.png
tapkey 0
wait 2500
shot f.png
tapkey 2
wait 2500
shot g.png
tapkey 7
wait 2500
shot c2.png
kpage 1
turn K2 1 400
wait 2000
shot c-up1.png
turn K2 1 400
wait 2000
shot c-up2.png
turn K2 -3 400
wait 2000
shot c-down1.png
turn K3 -12 60
wait 2000
shot c-close.png
turn K3 24 60
wait 2500
shot c-wide.png
wavstop
